# Raw photo drop folder for the "What We Offer" section — originals only.
# The 13 certification files alone are 162MB (6000x4000 each) and git keeps
# every blob forever, so these must never be committed. The curated, web-sized
# set the site actually loads is built from them by hand into
# public/assets/images/vvitu/whatweoffer/ (~1MB total) and IS committed.
public/assets/images/vvitu/WhatweOffer/
